# Fearless Swashbuckler (3/3 Fish Pirate, haste; "Vehicles you control have haste"): on turn one Bot1 casts it and an Air Response Unit (a 3/3 flying,
# vigilance Vehicle, Crew 1), and Memnite crews the Vehicle. The Vehicle has haste from the Swashbuckler, so both attack on turn one:
# a Pirate and a Vehicle attacked this combat, so "whenever you attack" draws three cards (Island, Forest, Mountain) and discards two
# of them (Island, Forest), leaving the Mountain. Bot2 takes 3 + 3 = 6 (the Vehicle flies, Bot2 has no blockers) and is at 14.
# Black Lotus pays {2} of the Vehicle and {1} of the Swashbuckler.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Air Response Unit
Fearless Swashbuckler
Memnite
Island
Forest
Mountain
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Air Response Unit.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fearless Swashbuckler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Air Response Unit.Activate(Ability: Crew)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Fearless Swashbuckler > Bot2; Air Response Unit > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Island; Forest)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Bot1.Hand = Mountain
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest; Island; Black Lotus
